# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

## [1.0] - 2026-09-10

### Added

* Basic from scratch neural network implementation in C.
* Configurable number of hidden layers.
* Configurable number of epochs.
* Configurable samples and input features (no limitation).
* Input and output layer initialization.
* Feed-forward propagation.
* Sigmoid activation function.
* Backpropagation algorithm.
* Delta/error calculation for output and hidden layers.
* Weight and bias updates using a configurable learning rate.
* Training over multiple epochs.
* Mean/squared error loss calculation.
* Support for multiple training samples.
* Console output for sample predictions, targets, and epoch loss.

### Network Architecture

* Input layer with configurable number of features.
* One or more hidden layers.
* Single-neuron output layer.
* Fully connected neuron layers.

### Training

* Forward propagation for predictions.
* Error calculation against target values.
* Backpropagation through hidden layers.
* Gradient-based weight and bias updates.
* Configurable learning rate and number of epochs.

## [1.0.1] - 2026-09-10

### Added
* Command-line argument parsing for hidden layers, epochs, learning rate, and filename.
